#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:2
msgid "Frame presentation protocol"
msgstr "画面呈现协议"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:6
msgid ""
"Synchronized updates (private mode 2026) let a program hand the terminal a whole frame at once, "
"so that it is shown without tearing. What the program cannot learn is when that frame reached the"
" screen, so programs that animate, draw strokes as they are made, or play video pace themselves "
"with timers and either waste work on frames the display never shows or lag behind it. The frame "
"presentation protocol is the other half: a report after each frame the terminal presents that "
"contains output from the program. It is an open terminal extension in the manner of the :doc"
":`tablet-protocol`: small, unobtrusive, easy to implement, and no change to what the TTY is."
msgstr ""
"同步更新（私有模式 "
"2026）让程序一次提交完整画面，避免撕裂。但程序无法知道该帧何时到达屏幕，因此动画、实时笔迹或视频程序只能用定时器控制节奏，可能浪费工作在从未显示的帧上，也可能落后于显示器。画面呈现协议补足另一半：终端每次呈现包含程序输出的画面后发送一条报告。它与"
" :doc:`tablet-protocol` 一样，是小巧、低干扰、易于实现的开放终端扩展，不改变 TTY 的本质。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:17
msgid "Framing"
msgstr "消息封装"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:19
msgid "Frames are ``OSC 777`` with the ``frame`` selector::"
msgstr "帧使用带有 ``frame`` 选择器的 ``OSC 777``：::"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:23
msgid ""
"They follow the rules every OSC 777 extension shares, which :doc:`extension-framing` gives: the "
"syntax of the fields, which frames are rejected, the units and the clock. ``v``, the protocol "
"version, is ``1``, and ``op`` is one of ``query``, ``cap``, ``mode`` and ``event``."
msgstr ""
"帧遵循 :doc:`extension-framing` 规定的 OSC 777 共用规则：字段语法、拒绝哪些帧、单位和时钟。协议版本 ``v`` 为 ``1``，``op`` 为 "
"``query``、``cap``、``mode`` 或 ``event``。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:29
msgid "Discovery"
msgstr "能力探测"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:31
msgid "A program asks the terminal whether it supports the protocol::"
msgstr "程序询问终端是否支持本协议：::"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:35
msgid ""
"``id`` is a non-negative 31 bit integer of the program's choosing, echoed in the reply so replies"
" can be matched to queries. A supporting terminal answers::"
msgstr "``id`` 是程序自行选择的非负 31 位整数，回复原样返回，以便匹配查询。支持协议的终端回答：::"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:40
msgid ""
"``caps`` is a bit set of what the terminal can report, currently always ``1`` for presentation "
"events. ``mode`` is the current state of the mode described below. ``period`` is the refresh "
"period of the display the window is on, in microseconds, or ``0`` when the terminal does not know"
" it. It changes when the window moves to another display, so a program that cares queries again "
"from time to time, or simply uses the value carried by every event. A terminal that does not "
"support the protocol ignores the query, so a program must time out and fall back to timers."
msgstr ""
"``caps`` 是终端报告能力的位集合，当前始终为 ``1``，表示呈现事件。``mode`` 为下述模式的当前状态。``period`` "
"表示窗口所在显示器的刷新周期，单位微秒；终端不知道时为 "
"``0``。窗口移到另一显示器时它会变化，有需要的程序可定期重新查询，或直接使用每条事件携带的值。不支持协议的终端会忽略查询，因此程序必须设置超时，并回退到定时器。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:50
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:52
msgid "Reports are off by default and turned on per terminal window with::"
msgstr "报告默认关闭，按终端窗口开启：::"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:56
msgid ""
"and off with ``mode=0``. Turning the mode on resets the sequence counter. The mode is local to "
"the window and is reset by ``RIS``. Programs must turn it off when they exit, suspend or fail, "
"and turn it back on when resumed. Multiplexers keep it with the rest of the terminal state and "
"turn it off when detaching. A terminal may let its user refuse the mode, for every program or for"
" some. A refused mode reads back as off and no frame is reported, so a program reads the mode "
"back rather than assume it was granted."
msgstr ""
"用 ``mode=0`` 关闭。开启模式会重置序号计数器。模式仅作用于当前窗口，并由 ``RIS`` "
"重置。程序必须在退出、挂起或失败时关闭，恢复时重新开启。多路复用器与其他终端状态一起保存它，并在脱离连接时关闭。终端可允许用户针对全部或部分程序拒绝模式；被拒绝时读回为关闭，不产生画面报告，因此程序应读回状态，而不是假定请求已获准。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:64
msgid ""
"A ``mode`` request without a ``mode`` field reads the state instead of changing it, and is "
"answered with::"
msgstr "不带 ``mode`` 字段的 ``mode`` 请求读取状态而不修改，回复为：::"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:69
msgid ""
"A program resuming after a reconnection reads the mode to learn whether it survived, rather than "
"assuming it did."
msgstr "程序重连后恢复时，应读回模式，确认是否仍然有效，而非假定状态保留。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:73
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "报告"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:75
msgid ""
"While the mode is on, the terminal sends one report each time it presents a frame to the display "
"that contains output the program wrote since the previous report::"
msgstr "模式开启时，终端每次向显示器提交包含自上次报告以来程序新写入内容的画面，都会发送一条报告：::"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:81
msgid ""
"``seq`` counts reports since the mode was turned on. ``t`` is the time the frame was handed to "
"the display system, in milliseconds on the clock the terminal uses for every extension, see :doc"
":`extension-framing`, so that it can be set against the ``t`` of the input a program drew the "
"frame for. ``tu`` is the microseconds past ``t``, ``0`` to ``999``, present when the terminal "
"measures the time that finely. This is not the time the frame was shown, which is the next "
"refresh of the display or later; a later version of the protocol may add that. ``period`` is the "
"refresh period in microseconds as in the ``cap`` reply."
msgstr ""
"``seq`` 从模式启用时起计数。``t`` 为画面交给显示系统的时刻，单位毫秒，使用全部终端扩展共用的时钟（见 :doc:`extension-framing`），可与触发该帧的输入事件的 "
"``t`` 对照。``tu`` 是 ``t`` 之后的微秒数，范围 ``0`` 至 "
"``999``，仅在终端能测量到该精度时出现。这不是画面真正显示的时刻，实际显示发生在下一次刷新或更晚；后续协议版本可能补充实际显示时刻。``period`` 与 ``cap`` "
"回复相同，以微秒表示刷新周期。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:91
msgid ""
"Every report stands for a frame, so none is ever merged with another or dropped, by the terminal "
"or by a relay, see :doc:`extension-framing`."
msgstr "每条报告都代表一帧，因此终端或中继绝不将其合并或丢弃，见 :doc:`extension-framing`。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:94
msgid ""
"A frame is reported once, however much output it contains, and a program that writes nothing "
"receives nothing, so an idle program is never woken. The command that turns the mode on is itself"
" output, so the first report follows the next presented frame and tells the program the period "
"without a query. Output that does not change what is on screen may still be followed by a report,"
" since the terminal counts output, not visible change. When the window is hidden or on an "
"inactive tab no frames are presented and no reports are sent, so a program must never block "
"indefinitely waiting for one: wait with a timeout, a few refresh periods long, and carry on."
msgstr "无论包含多少输出，一帧只报告一次；程序不写入内容就不会收到报告，因此空闲程序不会被唤醒。开启模式的命令本身也是输出，所以第一条报告会在下一次画面提交后到达，并直接提供周期，无须额外查询。即使输出未改变可见内容，仍可能产生报告，因为终端统计的是输出，而非可见变化。窗口被隐藏或位于非活动标签页时不会呈现画面，也不会发送报告，因此程序绝不能无限阻塞等待报告：应以几个刷新周期为超时，随后继续运行。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:105
msgid "Pacing with synchronized updates"
msgstr "配合同步更新控制绘制节奏"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:107
msgid ""
"The intended use is a render loop that submits a frame inside ``CSI ? 2026 h`` and ``CSI ? 2026 "
"l``, then waits for the report before starting the next one. With reports arriving once per "
"presented frame, the program draws exactly as fast as the display shows and no faster, and the "
"difference between the ``t`` of consecutive reports tells it the frame rate it is actually "
"achieving. A program that renders faster than the display should drop or merge frames rather than"
" queue them, since the terminal shows only the most recent output at each presentation."
msgstr ""
"预期用法是在渲染循环中，将一帧放在 ``CSI ? 2026 h`` 与 ``CSI ? 2026 l`` "
"之间提交，等待报告后再开始下一帧。每次画面呈现对应一条报告，程序的绘制速度就与显示速度一致，不会过快；相邻报告的 ``t`` "
"之差可得实际帧率。渲染快于显示的程序应丢弃或合并帧，而非排队，因为终端每次呈现时只显示最新输出。"

#: docs/frame-protocol.rst:116
msgid ""
"Reports are written to the program's input like keystrokes. A program must read its input while "
"waiting for a report, since other input, such as key presses, arrives in the same stream."
msgstr "报告像按键一样写入程序输入。等待报告时程序仍必须读取输入，因为按键等其他输入也会通过同一字节流到达。"

